      "content": "but if it's just \"confirmation bias,\" then why does it feel so purposeful? like, a bias doesn't make a receipt come out to ten billion to one odds. it feels more like a confirmation that my mindset is actually working. \n\nif I'm right, and my intention is actually aligning with these external patterns, shouldn't I be looking for more ways to leverage this? since the math says this is so statistically impossible, isn't it more logical to assume there's a connection between my focus and these events rather than just calling it a coincidence?",
